    "result_text": "Owner responses now include `displayName`, formatted as `LastName, FirstName` from the saved owner's names. The test suite passes; it's just one test, `AcceptanceTest.coreComputesDisplayName`, which failed before the change.\n\nI made two edits:\n- **`src/main/resources/openapi.yml`**: added a read-only `displayName` string to the `Owner` schema, so the generated `OwnerDto` has the field.\n- **`OwnerMapper.java`**: `toOwnerDto` now fills `displayName` from the owner's stored last and first names.\n\nBecause the value is built in the shared mapper, it also appears when owners are fetched, listed (in both API versions) or updated, not just when one is created. Nothing is stored in the database for it.",
